            <ArticleTitle>[The factor of intra-abdominal pressure in patients with morbid obesity].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pathogenetic peculiarities of chronic intraabdominal hypertension syndrome (CHIHS) in patients, suffering morbid obesity (MO), to whom bariatric operative interventions were performed, were studied. The intraabdominal pressure factor impact on the concurrent diseases and postoperative period course in patients, suffering MO, was analyzed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
